onal"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p022","text":"卅八年，伐秦，敗我武下，得其將識。是歳，文侯卒，子撃立，是爲武侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"將識","kind":"person","person_id":"0wt_iyc_10n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p001","text":"樂毅者，其先祖曰樂羊。樂羊為魏文侯將，伐取中山，魏文侯封樂羊以靈壽。樂羊死，葬於靈壽，其後子孫因家焉。中山復國，至趙武靈王時復滅中山，而樂氏後有樂毅。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"樂羊","kind":"person","person_id":"hnq_jmv_kxf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"樂羊","kind":"person","person_id":"hnq_jmv_kxf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"魏文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"魏文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"樂羊","kind":"person","person_id":"hnq_jmv_kxf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"樂羊","kind":"person","person_id":"hnq_jmv_kxf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0043","start":43,"end":47,"surface":"其後子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保留，不補未見姓名與直接父子關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0057","start":57,"end":61,"surface":"趙武靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"txj_z8z_5me_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"樂氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保留，不補未見姓名與直接父子關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m001-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-015-r053-c03","column":3,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"魏文侯斯元年。","source_row":54,"source_column":4,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-015-r053-c03-m000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"魏文侯斯","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依國別、紀年及原格上下文暫定；保留異文，不據同名自動合併。"}],"table_id":"shiji-015","table_fragment_id":"shiji-015-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-015-r053","table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r053-c03","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-015","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-015","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-015","source_revision":"2607002","source_header":["公元前","周","秦","魏","韓","趙","楚","燕","齊"],"row_year":{"era":"BCE","value":424,"astronomical_year":-423,"precision":"year","status":"digital_editorial_equivalence","source_quote":"424","source_cell_id":"shiji-015-r053-c00"}},{"id":"shiji-015-r070-c03","column":3,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"十八。文侯受經子夏。過段干木之閭常式。","source_row":71,"source_column":4,"prin